What this repo ships
--------------------
- Stock mine_sim runtime: `devkit/` (strategy-patched), `setup/`,
  `other_scripts/`, `Dockerfile`
- Public contest assets needed to run locally: `inputs/` (40 public scenes)
  and `datasets/maps/` (Dapai / Jiangtong maps)
- Strategy delta also mirrored under `overlay/devkit/` for applying onto a
  separately obtained official tree

What this repo does NOT ship
----------------------------
- Hidden-scenario packs used on the 183-scene online eval
- Pre-built Docker submission images / platform evaluation services
- Internal experiment `outputs/`

